EGPL Bot
EGPL Bot is a private utility used to support and preserve the EGPL Discord community.
Its Google Drive integration is used to maintain automated backups of EGPL Discord archives, synchronize archive files, preserve historical records, and support administrative projects based on those archives.
EGPL Bot accesses Google Drive only with authorization from the account owner.
For information about how Google user data is handled, see the [Privacy Policy](https://github.com/kutoej/egplbotdrive/blob/main/privacy%20policy).
